op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[161,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n我沒事。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n呼，幸好。\n當我看到外面都是您的妻女姊妹的屍體時，\n我還以為您已經遭遇不測了。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n呵呵……\n她們……都是我殺的。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n……啊？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n易京即將陷落，\n她們沒有能力保護自己，\n早死才是福氣！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,4]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n嗚嗚嗚……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n……………"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公！當年齊國曾失去七十餘城，\n近乎亡國，可是後來田單復國，\n終於反敗為勝！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n高祖皇帝更是屢屢敗給項羽，\n可是他從不放棄，\n最後開創了大漢江山！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n眼下雖然局勢險惡，但是只要我們\n不放棄希望，就還有機會捲土重來！\n主公何必如此想不開呢？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n…………"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公！我們快走吧！\n留得青山在，不怕沒柴燒。\n我們先穩住陣腳，日後再東山再起！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n東山再起？\n我還能去哪裡東山再起呢？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n我曾經登上天下最高的城樓，\n一眼望去盡收天下美景。\n要我再回到平地，打死我也不幹。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n……………"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n既然如此，末將也待在這裡，\n誓死伴您左右！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n…………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n子龍，你快走吧。\n這裡不是你該留的地方。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n都是我的錯誤決策才讓局勢惡化到\n如此地步，非常抱歉。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[161,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n子龍，其實我一直知道，\n你真正想追隨的人不是我，而是玄德！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n我現在命令你去找他，別再回頭！"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,9]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n你還待在這幹嘛？\n快點離開這裡！這是命令！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,11]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公！請受趙雲一拜！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,34,0,52,35,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[161,2,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n子龍！你先等一下！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n！！！！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n主公有何吩咐！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n因為我心亂如麻，\n有一件事情差點忘了交代！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n今後我的愛馬飛電就交給你照顧了！\n你可以幫牠找到適合的主人，\n再將飛電轉送給他！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,11]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n遵命！"]},{"op":61,"name":"get_item","args":[112,0,0,65535]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[161,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&公孙瓒\n永別了，子龍。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n永別了，主公。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,34,0,52,3,0]},{"op":49